{"reviewId": "66920859_84iP0PtHm", "review": {"abstract": "这里我们想说的是，中国工业化的原动力依然存在，依靠固定资产投资拉动的经济增长模式不会立即改变，中国在经济增长中利用财政政策的手段依然有效。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "chapterUid": 10, "content": "2025年终于拉不动了，贵州的高速里程已经超过日本，高铁地铁大面积亏损。有11个省级行政区被禁止新开基建工程。由政府主导的投资，跟市场化投资还是有很大区别的，中国的基础设施投资大概在十年前就该停止了，这些设施后续的维护费用都是天文数字，投资贷款已经压垮了地方财政。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "18489-18558", "createTime": 1761876443, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 10, "reviewId": "66920859_84iP0PtHm", "userVid": 66920859, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1762184821, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 20, "likes": [{"userVid": 403200981, "name": "超级爱吃炒螃蟹", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0009-ANWMxJ~iICjDR186B~v4we3/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "超级爱吃炒螃蟹", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-10", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作爱好者", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComm